---
import { person } from "../data/site";
---

<section class="sec wrap" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <header class="sec__head">
    <h2 id="about-title">About</h2>
    <p>Computer science student, building real software while I study.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="about">
    <div class="about__text sd-rise">
      <p>
        I'm in the seventh semester of a {person.degree} at {person.institution} in Bengaluru,
        with a CGPA of {person.cgpa}. Most of what I know came from building projects end to
        end: picking the problem, choosing the stack, and staying with it after it first works
        on my machine.
      </p>
      <p>
        That has meant writing a test suite for a computer-vision pipeline because its output
        was too noisy to trust by eye, and building an update channel into an Android app so
        people would actually receive the fixes. The overlap between machine learning and
        software that has to run reliably is where I want to work.
      </p>
      <p>
        Five hackathon placements taught me to cut scope and ship under a deadline. I came
        back to one of those weekend builds, Attention Scanner, and rebuilt it as a tested
        pipeline.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm looking for an internship or entry-level role where my code gets reviewed
        properly and I can keep learning from experienced engineers. I also take on
        freelance work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <dl class="about__facts sd-rise">
      <div><dt>Degree</dt><dd>{person.degree}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Institution</dt><dd>{person.institution}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Years</dt><dd>{person.years}, {person.semester}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>CGPA</dt><dd class="num">{person.cgpa}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>{person.location}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Open to</dt><dd>Internships, entry-level roles, freelance</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-7);
  }
  @media (min-width: 60rem) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
      column-gap: var(--space-8);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
  .about__text {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: var(--measure);
    font-family: var(--prose);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .about__text p:not(:first-child) {
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  /* the specification block: what this drawing is of */
  .about__facts {
    display: grid;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-2);
    background: var(--raised);
  }
  .about__facts div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .about__facts div:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }
  .about__facts dt {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding-top: 0.25em;
  }
  .about__facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
